  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A broad conformance release across pattern matching, modes/accumulators, XSLT 3.0 packages, xsl:copy namespaces, and XPath string literals. Patterns: chained predicates in a match pattern now use XPath filter semantics (each predicate re-indexes position()/last() against the survivors of the previous), and more pattern forms match (union/intersect operators, child::document-node(), a variable-reference pattern with a predicate, a parenthesized positional pattern, root() with a predicate). Modes: initial-mode=\"#default\" selects the declared default mode; mode-scoped accumulators are evaluated on the streamed initial-mode path (with XTDE3362 for a non-applicable accumulator). Packages: xsl:original resolves for every overridden kind; accepted components are visible and validated; xsl:override static errors (XTSE0010/3050/3060) are diagnosed; component references and xsl:key/global/output/character-map/namespace-alias resolve package-locally; cross-package template import precedence (§6.6.2) and XTSE3050 conflicts are honoured; a used package's private components are no longer visible; @package-version selects the correct version. Serialization: xsl:copy-of copy-namespaces=\"no\" no longer drops a copied element's own default namespace. Expressions: a raw & in an XPath string literal parses. Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.2.2 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.5.5. No breaking API changes. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
